WEBVTT

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.290
Back when I had this lost feeling in regards to justice,

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:47.540
no matter where I was or who I was with, I...

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:06.640
Konoha!

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:10.150
Episode 9: Party

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:30.000
The swimming test is next week.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.800
I'll look pretty bad if I can't learn to swim a bit better...

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:36.630
What's wrong?

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.510
I'm going now.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:48.480
Konoha.

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:51.020
What?

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.780
Onii-chan, what is your "justice"?

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:02.160
To me, it just seems like you're looking for praise.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.420
I'm definitely going to get stronger.

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.550
I want you to understand my justice.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.590
Do your best.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:28.970
It was like she was fading away from me with that smile...

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:32.560
But...

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:35.820
I'm different now, Konoha!

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:50.200
When my mother comes back, please tell her not to worry about me.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.710
Understood!

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.960
And you don't think this is a trap?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.460
It's that guy who was getting you to take what he claimed to be a "test," right?

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.220
If there's a chance Konoha could be there,

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.590
I'm going!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.950
I'm happy.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.780
Me too.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.080
I'm so happy now.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.420
I want to buy a house.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:38.040
What?

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:39.670
A house?

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:43.170
Save up money, buy a house, and live with my family there.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.880
That's my dream.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:48.850
Back when I first saved you,

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.560
I said I wanted a 10,000 yen reward, right?

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.560
Right.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:56.190
Could it be that's how you were saving up money?

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.440
That's my job.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:01.440
It's only natural to get a reward for your work.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:03.070
I haven't paid you.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.610
I won't take money from you.

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:06.200
Why?

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.950
Because you're the one I want in my family.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:21.460
Just leave it.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.670
I can't do that.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.470
Kouga, what happened?

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.600
Konoha is-?!

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:46.110
You did well in coming here!

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.200
Go on.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.490
I'll guide you there.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.370
Is Konoha there?

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:00.420
He's moving out!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.590
Let's start tracking him!

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:03.050
Yeah!

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.730
Is this another test of justice?

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:19.650
Is that what you think?

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:20.940
What are you after?!

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.770
You'll find out sooner or later.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.900
You still haven't given me an answer about Konoha!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:41.920
What is this?!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.010
The system's not responding!

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:46.670
What?!

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:47.840
Hayami-kun!

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:51.590
I can't get a hold of his position here, either.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:54.010
Something must have happened.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.560
For the time being, we'll search for the car!

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:57.890
Got it.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.980
I'll hurry to get things restored here, too.

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.150
You're going?

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.610
Something bad is happened!

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.200
When I come back,

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.490
I'll tell you and only you everything.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:17.870
What do you mean, "everything"?

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:20.120
About me.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.370
You're the only one I want to know it all.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:30.130
Can you wait for me here?

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:31.010
Yeah.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:33.510
I'll be waiting.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.680
Sorry, Mr. Chairman.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:44.150
It's good to have someone close to you.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.690
You've woken up.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:58.990
Don't go removing that earpiece.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.960
It's your only way to contact me.

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:10.210
Well then, the test is starting.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:16.680
Don't worry, I left your weapons as-is.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:19.770
We want to be fair with one another, don't we?

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:25.980
You call blocking any contact with the oustide world "fair"?!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:29.230
The test is something for you to do on your own.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.900
I came here to see Konoha,

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.530
not to take some test!

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:37.780
It's too bad, but your sister isn't here.

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:40.950
The test started with that phone call.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.580
It's so easy to kidnap you.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.500
Don't screw with me!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.590
If Konoha's not here, I'm going home!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:53.800
Do you really think she's not here?

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:58.600
You don't think I was lying just now?

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.970
If you come to where I am,

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:03.480
you'll understand the truth.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.020
Please look for me.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.940
I'm watching from nearby!

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.600
This is delicious, isn't it?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.730
It's true!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:52.940
Amazing!

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:56.860
For real!

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.330
Kouga-kun!

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:10.170
What the hell is this?

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.590
It's a party.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:18.590
You've been a big hit with the girls ever since the arson incident.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.350
This is also a test.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:26.180
Will you prioritise looking for me and learning about your sister,

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.690
or will you run away with the girls?

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:36.150
If I remember correctly, three people died before when you chose your sister.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.910
Everyone, please wait!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:49.250
Hey, can I get your autograph?

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.880
I'm not really a big fan of you,

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.300
but someone I know asked me to get it.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.970
If I can get your signature, I'll be out of here in no time,

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.880
so hurry up and write it?

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.140
Excuse me.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:06.770
Can I... go to the bathroom first?

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:07.850
Huh?

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.060
He's so cute!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.560
The bathroom's over there!

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:11.690
Thank you.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:14.310
Hey, should we take a peek?

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:16.360
Or should I say, should we go attack him?!

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.200
What if I don't find out where Konoha is...

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.290
...even if I look for that guy?

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:33.460
He's already killed three people!

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.540
He admitted it!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:37.960
What should I do...?

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.550
I can't leave the girls alone like this!

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:47.060
Konoha... Are you really here?

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.230
Maybe...

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:01.860
Hello?

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:03.860
Oba-san, it's me.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:05.870
Jin?!

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.250
Want to run away with me?

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.630
Don't you think there's something weird about this place?

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:23.130
It shouldn't be possible for our phones to get no signal at all!

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:28.510
So I went to see if there's a way to get outside.

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:29.220
Hey!

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:32.640
Who is this girl?

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:36.360
Is this another part of his test, too?

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.570
Please look.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:41.400
See?

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.540
This is weird, right?

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.540
It's so cute!

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.170
Kouga-kun, let's go!

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:04.340
This place is totally weird!

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:07.050
Wait, something's happening over there.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:09.550
Oh, you're over here!

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.600
Come here, Kouga-kun.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:15.560
A new room just appeared!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:16.940
A new room?

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:18.940
Yeah! Won't you come see it?

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:21.690
Yeah, I'll come in just a bit.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.690
Well, come quickly!

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.200
Everybody's waiting for you!

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:28.950
Hey, Kouga-kun!

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.830
What's going on over there?

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.830
It might be a new trap, or...

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:38.080
No, this escape route here could be the trap!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:41.960
Or will this be a passage to get me closer to him?

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:45.340
I should check out the other room.

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.010
If I use this path,

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:48.640
I'll do it with everyone...

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:49.850
That's right!

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:50.850
If we're all together, then...

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.640
If this was Jin, he'd save everyone!

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:00.520
You go on alone.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:04.320
If this path connects to the outside, contact the police.

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:05.280
What will you do, Kouga-kun?

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.280
I'm going to save everyone.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:12.700
Like you said, this place is really dangerous.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:14.790
So you should leave quickly, OK?

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.250
Hey, come see!

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:24.500
See, it's that room!

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:28.760
Everybody, Kouga came back!

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.180
Kouga-kun!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.480
What's she doing?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.570
Kouga-kun.

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.820
You were wrong again.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.660
What?

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.370
What is this?

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:11.300
I can't open the door!

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:12.820
What is this?

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:13.930
Open up!

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:16.060
Someone, open the door!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:17.930
Everyone calm down!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:20.600
You murderer!

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.480
It's not like that!

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.520
Please listen!

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:25.730
I don't need your excuses!

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.490
Hurry up and let us out from here!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:32.990
The door opened...

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:37.990
Wait! Hold on!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:39.830
Please wait!

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.380
You're awful.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.500
Just hitting him without even listening to an explanation.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.680
Everyone, please wait!

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:56.850
Huh?

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:01.060
No way!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.280
What is this?

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.280
Why isn't it opening again?

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.870
I'm giving you a new test.
Why isn't it opening again?

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:23.290
Do you hear something?

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:42.930
Listen up!

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:49.190
There's an elevator up ahead that will take you to me.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:53.150
Will you leave the girls and run through right now,

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:56.820
or will you defeat the hammer man and come with everyone?

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.620
Which would justice choose?

00:16:58.620 --> 00:16:59.700
It goes without saying.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:03.460
Cutting mode.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.590
Bringing down evil is what justice is!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.340
He's pathetic.

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:23.600
You've gotten all fired up, haven't you, Jirou-san?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.600
Well, I should go soon, too.

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:32.730
Are you OK with not telling him you're here?

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:36.110
Right now I don't want to talk to anybody.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:39.450
Then what does that make me?

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.540
Akemi-san, you're different.

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:45.870
You can't depend on Jin at a time like this?

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:50.630
Now... I'm even scared of Jin-kun.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:56.800
Even though something's going on,

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.680
nobody will tell me anything.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:03.770
I'm glad you remembered me when this trouble happened.

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:09.770
I feel like I've had a hole in my heart ever since Jin left.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:14.650
You've read that letter countless times, haven't you?

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:19.660
Was Jin-kun really taken in by his parents?

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:20.820
Huh?

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:24.870
After all, he's always in Undertown.

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:29.620
I feel like I don't know a thing about Jin-kun.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:36.010
But there's no doubt that he's a nice guy.

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:38.550
Have a little faith in him!

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:02.350
Huh?

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:03.450
It went out.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:06.330
Hey.

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:08.830
How are you doing?

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:11.210
Humans...

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:16.210
There's something interesting we wanted to let you know,

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:19.630
so we're going to force you to pay attention!

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:21.840
What's going on all of a sudden?

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:26.680
First, let's introduce ourselves.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.350
We're EVOL.

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:31.690
Even though we look this way, we're not human.

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:33.730
Haitani...

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.360
So what's EVOL?

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.860
Seeing is believing.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:44.120
We'll switch over to the outside camera,

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.120
so I want you to see this first.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.370
So everyone!

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:50.870
Let's revert.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.210
Hey, hey, what's this prank?

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:56.130
He's messed up in the head.

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:59.010
Just who is messed up?

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.020
What is this?

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:10.230
They're all the same thing!

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.270
Please turn it off!

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:17.360
You're right, it's kind of gross.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:23.530
Hello?

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.070
Oba-san, it's me!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:27.030
Are you watching TV?

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:30.450
I was watching, but something weird happened.

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:31.870
I turned it off immediately.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:32.750
That's good.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:36.420
Also, Konoha's there, isn't she?

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:38.420
She's not here.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.130
If so, that's good.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.800
But if she arrives there, let her in your room.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:45.800
Don't let her outside under any circumstances.

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:48.760
What is this? What's going on?

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:50.180
For the time being, I'm counting on you!

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:58.190
The other person went to Middletown.

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:01.480
If it were Kouga, he would've prioritised his sister.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:05.820
But this is the result of that!

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:10.240
Did you have fun?

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.500
We were made by humans,

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:18.630
a freak show of us killing each other for their profit.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:21.000
But one day we noticed...

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:24.880
"Why is it we have to do this?"

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:27.760
It got us pretty angry.

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:29.970
So we decided...

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:35.270
...to get our revenge on the humans.

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:46.030
You can't save them all anymore.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:51.790
Your justice has a serious flaw!

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:54.370
What is it you lack...?

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.750
Do you know?

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:16.140
Your birthday comes,

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:22.980
and I pick a present for you.

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:29.240
I stop my feet on fifth street.

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:35.910
This love can't be changed.

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:45.460
Darling, stop the clock, stop your head,

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:51.300
stop your heart, your eyes and ears, and everything.

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:58.140
Darling, all the words I received from you.

00:22:58.140 --> 00:23:09.570
Hugging you as if embracing a rose with no thorns.

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:17.200
Darling, the miracle of the two of us meeting in this world.

00:23:17.200 --> 00:23:28.630
With only a trace of that, me loving you.

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:37.470
How strange.

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:40.280
Even though I'm in a situation like this,

00:23:40.280 --> 00:23:41.730
and even though I'm hurting that much...

00:23:42.410 --> 00:23:42.540
This... This feeling!

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:45.030
Puppet
This... This feeling!

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:45.470
Puppet
